{"v":4,"catch":"現在成為海洋中的頂級鯊魚之一！","desc":"Shark Adventure 讓您扮演鯊魚的角色，您的主要重點是盡可能多地獲得星星，同時避開遇到的障礙。 這是一款非常引人入勝且令人印象深刻的遊戲，具有許多有趣和令人愉快的機制。\n\n這不是一個簡單的遊戲，它需要大量的精度和注意力。 但這表明這種體驗實際上是多麼令人興奮和有趣。 試試看，看看您是否能成為終極鯊魚！\n\n特徵：\n在開闊水域扮演鯊魚的角色\n避開障礙物，積累星星\n快節奏的遊戲","publisher":"Gametry","release":"2022-02-03","genres":["街機","冒險"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3bda93972ed499b7ab7824262ca953ab9b00551c33b07af7ecccf288a4852d9d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/da3063a8db6173826b1324650e6599a815a5d10f75074344c6b6958962dccb14.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8901882a5c31d1e44b52635ec955c432213233feeda11a05500e5d0d35eceeec.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/03e05a17eba0c68128cb7bfea1513815476a9ae699a261c21720416fd0f2c1cc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7163d92056e24601835233159f68e46d0ac5ffab69deb4e76b1f42d828025e39.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8fea352018cf83c24f173d50036b8578b9e2922fc2ade9ba4af6916ce6e6a406.jpg"],"titleId":"01001a101792e000","dlc":[]}